msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. I wanted to ask you some things about the Golden Agu you've been "
"selling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Who let you in here? And what the hell is this \"Golden Agu\"\r\n"
"you speak of? I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Oh! Boss, new guy, great timing! I just received word that the utility-grade"
" pork shipments arrived from both China and Australia without a hitch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"So! What should we label our mystery meat this time? I know we've been "
"calling it Golden Agu, but how about bumping it up to platinum status!? Ooh,"
" that oughta go over well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"You... absolute... fuckwit! Do you not know how to close your mouth when "
"outsiders are around!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Come on, boss, isn't this the new guy? I mean, he sure doesn't look like "
"he's on the up and up about our little operation, but I'm sure we can fill "
"him in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"You know what... I'm outta here! If you have any special inquiries, talk to "
"my assistant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"You're not going anywhere until I get the truth! Now come clean about the "
"pork, or prepare to get pork-chopped!"
msgstr ""

